# KAZU MAGI SYSTEM local-only edition
# Normally no .env file is required for local development.
# scripts/local-dev.mjs generates a local AES-256-GCM vault key automatically
# under .magi-local/ and never exposes it to the browser.
#
# Optional overrides:
# PORT=5173
# MAGI_LOCAL_DATA_DIR=.magi-local
